      "project": "packages/apps/Dialer",
      "reason": "Connect the complete Android 17 AOSP Dialer Telecom lifecycle to model priority and the fail-closed AIOS Call Intelligence policy and capture service.",
      "rebase_notes": "Re-export from the tracked Dialer base, preserve the four-file footprint, then rerun host validation, preview builds, emulator Telecom smoke, and every physical dialer/call gate.",
